  "description": "550 Sq Feet. Beautiful large, bright,  spacious 1 bedroom south facing apartment available in the highly sought after Academy Building Park West. \n\nThe apartment benefits from excellent natural light, a sunny facing aspect with a modern open plan living and kitchen area.\n\nAccommodation comprises of a large double bedroom King size bed, fitted wardrobes, tiled main bathroom with power shower and bath, utility room/boiler room, fitted kitchen and comfortable living space. Large entrance hallway, located in a secure and well-maintained development in Park West.\n\n1 secure parking space in underground carpark.\n\nThere is a train station on the doorstep, excellent transport links and easy access to the M50, Liffey valley and Dublin city Centre.\n\nThe apartment features:\n1 double bedroom south facing apartment \nKing size bed\nFitted wardrobes \nPowershower and bath with wood furnishings \nbright open plan living area\nmodern fitted kitchen with all  mod cons\nsouth facing balcony\nUtility room/boiler room\nsecure development\nexcellent transport links (Luas is within walking distance with onsite Train Station and Dublin Bus)\nclose to shops and communities\n1 dedicated secure undergound parking space\nexcellent location \n\nviewing is highly recommended\n\nSome photos have been digitally staged to show how the rooms may be presented for illustrative purposes.",
